OL,3,GNEWSAMechanic who falsified MOT before
OL,4,Acrash that killed three given community
OL,5,Aorder
OL,6,
OL,7,FA mechanic who gave a car a fraudulent
OL,8,FMOT just weeks before it was involved
OL,9,Fin a fatal crash that killed three
OL,10,Fpeople has been given a 12-month
OL,11,Fcommunity order.
OL,13,FNeil John Lewis, 47, from Cardiff, had
OL,14,Fpreviously pleaded guilty to fraud by
OL,15,Ffalse representation.
OL,17,FEve Smith, 21, Darcy Ross, 21, and
OL,18,FRafel Jeanne, 24, died when the car
OL,19,Fcrashed into woodland in St Mellons,
OL,20,FCardiff, in March 2023. They lay
OL,21,Fundiscovered for two days. Two other
OL,22,Fpeople survived.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
